 action! Whether you\u2019re a seasoned pro or a newcomer to the sport, this immersive game allows you to step onto the court and experience the thrill of tennis like never before.\n\nIn Smash Court Master VR, you\u2019ll face off against intelligent AI opponents or challenge your friends in exciting multiplayer matches. Master your serves, volleys, and powerful smashes as you refine your skills to dominate the competition. With realistic physics and intuitive controls, every shot feels authentic, making you feel like a real tennis champion.\n\nExplore various courts, from grass to clay, and unlock a variety of gear and customization options to enhance your gameplay. With dynamic challenges and engaging gameplay modes, Smash Court Master VR offers endless fun and competition. Are you ready to smash your way to victory and claim your title as the ultimate Smash Court Master?", "short_description": "Step onto the virtual tennis court in Smash Court Master VR! Experience thrilling matches, master your skills, and compete against AI or friends. Elevate your game and become the ultimate tennis champion in this immersive sports experience!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://tulipapps.com/meta-quest-privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Tulip Apps", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.tulipapps.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "support